# covers: 3 E4.1, 3 E4.6, 3 E6.7
# fixture: phase3-pvp
# Pending engine/client integration; declaration is not execution evidence.
# Timeouts: received-state delivery 10 ticks *100ms *3 =3s (A1).
# Login/RPC: existing runner allowance5s *3=15s; movement24 tiles/4 tiles per second *3=18s.
# Fixture combat30s *3=90s; no damage calculation determines a wait.
# Pinned dp3ca488dd src/main/resources/data/stats/skills/01100-01199.xml:1645,1846:
# Wind Strike base hitTime4000ms *3=12s; Ice Bolt base3100ms *3 rounds up to12s.
# 01000-01099.xml:554,1553,1560: Resurrection6000ms *3=18s, Might1200s *3=3600s.
# A6: regen30ticks *100ms *3=9s; A16/R7: flag1200ticks *100ms *3=360s.
# Boundaries are checked against received ticks/deadlines; source waits are conservative budgets.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.WaitFor own_sp >= 0 3
nf.WaitFor entity_in_view 01970000-0000-7000-8000-000000000031 30
nf.Target template:skill_target
nf.WaitFor target != none 3
nf.Cast 1177
nf.WaitFor cast_results >= 1 12
nf.WaitFor npc_target_is_owner 12
nf.Expect skill_hate_outcome_coherent
nf.Expect skill_damage_matches_oracle 1177
# Total budget >= sum of the derived per-step timeouts plus30s exit grace.
nf.Within 120
